~ sign
Sign: This one lets you keep walking while it talks. Most things here do not.
Sign: Cassie will not let you move. She needs you to stay.
=> END


~ jar
$> advance_quest("jar")
## Fairy, tree and shape each take it.
JAR. Something small inside scratches at the glass. It has been scratching for a long time.
=> END


~ door_locked
Locked. Cassie has the key. She will not let go of it easily.
=> END


~ door_open
$> advance_quest("help_cassie")
$> add_favor("cassie", 1)
## Spend what Cassie owes you by talking to her.
The door opens. Behind you, Cassie whispers a number.
=> END


~ chest
ASPECT OF HATE. It is warm, like something just let go of it.
=> END


~ loaf
BREAD. Stale. Someone left it here for you. Stacks to 5.
=> END


~ pile
3 ASPECT OF HATE. They do not stack. The pile is always full again when you look back.
=> END


~ pile_small
3 ASPECT OF HATE. This pile does not grow back. Something already ate the rest.
=> END


~ full
Your hands are full. They are shaking.
=> END


~ bread_used
Stale bread. It tastes like a kitchen you cannot picture anymore. You feel calmer.
=> END


~ gate_locked
A locked gate. Roots hold it shut. They tighten when you touch them. Ask the tree.
=> END


~ gate_open
$> advance_quest("feed_tree")
The roots pull back. Slowly. Like they do not want to.
if get_debt("fairy") > 0
	$> add_sanity(-25 * get_debt("fairy"))
	$> set_fact("debt.fairy", 0)
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	## 25 sanity per fairy debt.
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] There you are.
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] You owe me. I am not taking it now. I took it when you were not looking.
	Fairy: Check your hands. One of them is lighter than it was.
=> END


~ spring
$> add_sanity(10)
## Once.
Water. Cold and clean. Your reflection moves a moment too late. You feel calmer anyway.
=> END


~ final_chest
End of the showcase.
if get_debt("tree") > 0
	$> add_sanity(-20 * get_debt("tree"))
	$> set_fact("debt.tree", 0)
	$> add_opinion("tree", -1)
	## 20 sanity per tree debt.
	Roots under the chest. The tree collects. It does not say sorry anymore.
if get_favor("fairy") + get_favor("cassie") > 0
	Still owed to you. Fairy {{get_favor("fairy")}}. Cassie {{get_favor("cassie")}}. Spend it, before they decide you were never here.
=> END


~ nail
if has_item("iron_nail") or is_quest_done("iron_nail")
	You already took the iron nail. The hole in the stump is still bleeding sap.
	=> END
$> remove_item("aspect_of_hate")
$> give_item("iron_nail")
$> advance_quest("iron_nail")
IRON NAIL. The hate drains out of your hand into the wood. The wood lets go. Your hand stays cold.
=> END


~ nail_stuck
if not get_level_flag("showcase.nail_wanted")
	An iron nail in a stump. Nobody asked for it. Yet.
else
	It will not move. It wants hate. The red pile has plenty.
=> END


~ shape
Something stands here. It has your face. It looks more like you than you remember looking.
- Back away
	$> add_sanity(-10)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "ran")
	You run. It does not follow.
	% You hear it exhale. You do not have breath to spare.
	% Behind you, something with your walk goes the other way.
	% It is still standing where it was. It is also in front of you.
## Fake under sanity 50, bites at 50 or more.
- Touch it
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "touched")
	if get_sanity_zone() < 2
		Your hand goes through.
		% Nothing there. You are not sure there ever was.
		% It was cold. The cold of a hand that has been waiting.
	else
		$> add_sanity(-15)
		It bites. It has your teeth.
		[#sanity_glitch] It chews. It is thinking.
- Feed it bread [if has_item("bread") /]
	$> remove_item("bread")
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "fed")
	It eats the way you eat. It watches you the whole time. Then it leaves.
- Open the jar at it [if has_item("jar") /]
	$> remove_item("jar")
	$> advance_quest("jar")
	$> set_fact("choice.jar", "shape")
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "jar")
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	It takes what was inside. It leaves, and what it took screams the whole way. Somewhere, the fairy saw that.
- Call in the fairy. Two favors. [if get_favor("fairy") >= 2 /]
	$> add_favor("fairy", -2)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "favor")
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] Mine now.
	Fairy: [#sanity_glitch] Do not ask what I do with it. We are settled.
	You are not sure the shape left. You are not sure it was ever the shape.
- Show it the nail [if has_item("iron_nail") /]
	$> add_opinion("fairy", -1)
	$> set_fact("choice.shape", "iron")
	Iron. It flinches the way you would. It leaves. The fairy saw that.
=> END


~ idol_hungry
if get_quest_stage("idol") == -1
	$> advance_quest("idol")
	## It eats 5 sanity per second near it.
	Idol: Hungry. You will do.
Idol: Three hate. Or stand here, and I take it out of you instead.
- Feed it three hate [if has_item("aspect_of_hate", 3) /]
	$> remove_item("aspect_of_hate", 3)
	$> set_level_flag("showcase.idol_fed")
	$> advance_quest("idol")
	## Interact again to push it over.
	Idol: Full. The stone cracks.
	Idol: There was something else in the hate. Did you notice? It is gone now. You can stop trying to remember it.
- Leave
	Idol: I am patient. You are not. Stay a little longer.
=> END


~ idol
$> advance_quest("idol")
$> add_sanity(15)
It falls. The red drains out of the floor. You feel lighter, and you do not know what you lost.
=> END
